================================================================================
  RECURSIVE TILING DECOMPOSITION OF THE STAIRCASE
  opus-2026-03-23-S234
================================================================================

  STAIRCASE GEOMETRY:
  δ_k has k rows, C(k+1,2) = k(k+1)/2 cells.
  Row r (0-indexed) has k-r cells at columns c=0,...,k-r-1.

  δ_1 (n=3): 1 rows, 1 cells, 2 tilings
  δ_2 (n=4): 2 rows, 3 cells, 8 tilings
  δ_3 (n=5): 3 rows, 6 cells, 64 tilings
  δ_4 (n=6): 4 rows, 10 cells, 1024 tilings
  δ_5 (n=7): 5 rows, 15 cells, 32768 tilings
  δ_6 (n=8): 6 rows, 21 cells, 2097152 tilings

  DECOMPOSITION 1 (Mode A): δ_k = δ_{k-1} + anti-diagonal strip
  Strip cells: row r, col k-1-r for r=0..k-1 → k cells
  Inner δ_{k-1} has C(k,2) cells. Total: C(k,2) + k = C(k+1,2) ✓

  δ_2: inner δ_1=1 cells + strip=2 cells = 3 = 3 ✓
  δ_3: inner δ_2=3 cells + strip=3 cells = 6 = 6 ✓
  δ_4: inner δ_3=6 cells + strip=4 cells = 10 = 10 ✓
  δ_5: inner δ_4=10 cells + strip=5 cells = 15 = 15 ✓
  δ_6: inner δ_5=15 cells + strip=6 cells = 21 = 21 ✓

  DECOMPOSITION 2 (Mode B): δ_k = δ_{k-2} + L-border
  L-border = left column (k-1 cells) + bottom row (k-1 cells) - corner (1 shared)
  = 2(k-1) - 1 = 2k-3 cells

  δ_3: inner δ_1=1 + L=3 = 4 = 6 ✗
  δ_4: inner δ_2=3 + L=5 = 8 = 10 ✗
  δ_5: inner δ_3=6 + L=7 = 13 = 15 ✗
  δ_6: inner δ_4=10 + L=9 = 19 = 21 ✗

  DECOMPOSITION 3 (Two overlapping sub-staircases):
  δ_k contains two copies of δ_{k-1} overlapping in δ_{k-2}:
  - 'Top' δ_{k-1}: rows 0..k-2 (delete bottom row)
  - 'Left' δ_{k-1}: shift columns (delete rightmost column)
  - Overlap: δ_{k-2}
  - Critical cell: (k-1, 0) = bottom-left corner = SOURCE-SINK ARC

  δ_3: |top|=3 + |left|=3 - |overlap|=1 + 1 = 6 = 6 ✓
  δ_4: |top|=6 + |left|=6 - |overlap|=3 + 1 = 10 = 10 ✓
  δ_5: |top|=10 + |left|=10 - |overlap|=6 + 1 = 15 = 15 ✓
  δ_6: |top|=15 + |left|=15 - |overlap|=10 + 1 = 21 = 21 ✓

